    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements linear decay dynamics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class decreases a value linearly over time according to a specified decay rate. It is derived from <ref refid="class_decay" kindref="compound">Decay</ref> and overrides the apply method. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
